{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"15397","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v20272","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"AKIRA","creatorId":"vndb:s406","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5313","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s406","name":"AKIRA","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:96207","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"桜井光","creatorId":"vndb:s4","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1820","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4","name":"桜井光","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:96208","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"マッツミュージックスタジオ","creatorId":"vndb:s414","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s414","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s414","name":"マッツミュージックスタジオ","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:135674","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"AKIRA","creatorId":"vndb:s406","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s406","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s406","name":"AKIRA","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:135672","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c33464","characterName":"The A","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18907","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10957"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11884"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33464"},"originalCharacterName":"The A","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An expressionless young man full of mystery who never reveals anything about himself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the one guiding Lily through the Underground. Some have dubbed him \"The Faceless Man\" or \"Air Head\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the one who gives the name \"Lily\" to the young girl with an Elysian Eye that set foot in the fantastical realm of Underground New York, and he also operates that One-Car Subway Train that seems to move and stop at its own will while guiding Lily toward Manhattan."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He rarely displays any emotion, and occasionally he protects Lily from danger even as he flatly tells her the truth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33464"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の素性を一切明かすことのない、謎に満ちた、表情のない青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リリィを導く 《地下世界》 の人間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通称は 「顔のない男」 や 「からっぽ頭（エア・ヘッド）」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異形と化したニューヨークである 《地下世界》 に足を踏み入れた黄金瞳の少女にリリィという名を与え、意思を持つかのように移動と停止を繰り返す “1輛だけの地下鉄” を操り、マンハッタンを目指す彼女を導いていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼には感情が殆どなく、従って、表情も殆どない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"淡々と事実を述べながらリリィを導く彼は、時に、彼女を危険から守る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11884","sourceWorkId":"14286","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"不愿透露自己任何信息的、充满谜团的、面无表情的青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引导リリィ的《地下世界》的人类。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一般称为「顔のない男」或者「からっぽ頭（エア・ヘッド）」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对踏进化作异形的纽约《地下世界》的拥有黄金瞳的少女，赠与リリィ这一名字，"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"操纵着像是拥有意识一样的不断重复着移动和停止的“唯一一辆的地铁”，引导着前往曼哈顿的她。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他基本没有感情，也没什么表情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一边淡然叙述着事实一边引导着リリィ的他，偶然也会从危险中守护她。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18907"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/757deee80d8b1df01a9e87fc34ec3b459ed7cfeab645ccf3e4612da2fdf2bdb6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d73d683fb8fde59fa456ec6d8e2bbf63248b4ab2973fc4d13cc97cee5f3d2af.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古河 徹人","creatorId":"vndb:s299","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s299","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s299","name":"古河 徹人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71669","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33467","characterName":"エリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["11882"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33467"},"originalCharacterName":"エリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the main heroines, and the only one on the surface."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a girl with an Elysian Eye who travels through the ruins of New York on the surface. Three years ago (1904) in December, her left eye gained its golden, feline hue."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She harbors a strong will and bravery that belies her demure appearance. She is also tough, and she comes to the vast, ruined remains of old New York City all by herself, without anyone's aid. As she traverses the very real ruins, she is joined by her Tarantula, a multi-legged ambulatory bag she created herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Normally she would be a student attending Yale Engine University, but she's currently taking a break from it. Back when she attended high school in her home state of Connecticut, there was a man she held some affection toward. Even though they both felt deeply for one another, they never managed to become lovers. As her recollections and past memories are revealed, it becomes clear that man is who she searches for in the ruins of old New York."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33467"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にしてヒロイン。　作中における、唯一の、地上の人間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"廃墟と化した地上のニューヨークを歩く、黄金瞳の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年前 （1904年） の12月以来、左目が猫科の動物に似た “黄金瞳” に変わっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人しそうな容姿には不相応の勇気を備え、強い意思を持つ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気丈な性格。誰の助けもなく、たったひとりで広大な廃墟都市である旧ニューヨーク・シティを訪れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自ら開発した多脚式歩行鞄を連れて、廃墟という現実を歩き続ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来はイェール機関大学に通う学生だが、休学中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"故郷であるコネチカット州のハイスクールに通っていた頃、ほのかな想いを交わした初恋の相手がいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"互いに深く想い合っていたものの、恋人同士にはならなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"回想で徐々に提示される過去の記憶により、彼女が旧ニューヨークで探すのが、その人物であることが明かされていく──"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11882","sourceWorkId":"14286","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/999f246eeaafcbcfec7fa90bd8f8e3aab42ab13a717fbe0a6285d1b1b8324222.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3b43761d76a9aef190a898485bde06a51d3030fb5c391a304b109b18e0545606.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野月 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s298","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s298","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s298","name":"野月 まひる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71668","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33471","characterName":"ラッキー・ルチアーノ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18908","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10957"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11886"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33471"},"originalCharacterName":"ラッキー・ルチアーノ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man residing in the Underground who should have been loved by Lady Luck."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He always sports a hat, and he continues to pop up throughout Lily's journey after first meeting her and proclaiming he could manipulate fate. He's the only man capable of getting along relatively well with A and Jaguarman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a city-bred dandy clad in a sharp suit, and up until five years ago he used to appear as the wise head of some mafia. He created a whole crime syndicate and used to run the entire underground society of New York."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He still continues to love the one woman that lies beyond The Wall in Manhattan."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33471"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸運の女神に愛されたはずの男。 《地下世界》 の人間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運命を操る帽子男を名乗り、リリィの前に姿を見せ、以後、つかず離れず彼女の旅路に顔を出すこととなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aやジャガーマンと比較的話が合うのはこの男のみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"洒落たスーツに身を包む、都会の伊達男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつては、5年前までは才気あふれるマフィア幹部として頭角を現していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"犯罪シンジケートを作り出し、ニューヨークの裏社会すべてを掌握しかけたこともあるという。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マンハッタンの「巨壁（ザ・ウォール）」の先にいるひとりの女を愛し続けている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11886","sourceWorkId":"14286","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本应受幸运女神眷顾的男人。《地下世界》的人类。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称操纵命运的帽子男出现在リリィ的面前，之后若即若离地在她的旅途现身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能与A或者ジャガーマン比较谈得上话的就只有这个男人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穿着帅气的西装的、都会的潇洒男人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"5年前以前是个才华横溢的黑社会干部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"搞出了犯罪组织，掌握着纽约的地下组织的所有。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一直爱着某个在曼哈顿的「巨壁（The Wall）」那边的女人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18908"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f5fa37ba37420109f7c957ad15f1374d3aab09e095ebd64691631829702cf52.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b438e5336c6545ab65d387c542c993fae9f741275480c769b6d0ae3e8a78f0d7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小次狼","creatorId":"vndb:s1643","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1643","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1643","name":"桜木 章人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71675","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33474","characterName":"マオ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18909","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10957"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11885"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33474"},"originalCharacterName":"マオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who laughs as she watches Lily."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a denizen of the Underground, and maybe human? She bears cat ears atop her head and a tail grows from her butt, making her an abnormal girl with slightly different features than a proper human. She likes to appear in high places and chuckle as she looks down at Lily."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a hedonistic attitude, and she's always smiling. She frequently laughs at others as well, but she takes no pleasure in doing so. The truth is that she actually wishes she could stop smiling and laughing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her true form is different from her current appearance, but just like Jaguarman, she gained the outward appearance of a beastman due to her own internal nature. Though there is one definitive difference between her and the jaguar man."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33474"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"リリィを見つめては笑ってみせる娘。 《地下世界》 の人物。人間？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の上に猫の “耳” を持ち、尻には尻尾を生やした、正しい人間とは些か異なったかたちを持つ異形の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく高台にいて、リリィを見下ろしては 「ひひひ」 と笑う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"享楽的な性格。いつも笑っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しきりに誰かを嘲笑するが、そうする時、マオは一切の享楽を感じることはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は、笑うことを、彼女はやめたがっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来の姿は現在とは別だったが、ジャガーマンと同じく、自らに充ちる性質のために獣人としての外見を得ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、豹男とは、決定的に異なる点がひとつある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11885","sourceWorkId":"14286","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"看着リリィ而笑的女生。 《地下世界》的人。人类？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"头上长着猫“耳”，屁股长着尾巴，与正常人类的样子有点不同的异形少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是在高处俯视着リリィ「嘻嘻嘻」地笑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"享乐主义。总是在笑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不时会露出嘲笑，然而这个时候的她并不感到快乐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其实，她很不想笑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来的样子与现在不同，但是与ジャガーマン一样，为了填充自己的性质而获得了兽人的模样。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是与豹男有绝对不一样的一个地方。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18909"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/668607a0db485732524c33115abf7f350978f654e8b62158f7d05a8458c23434.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95abb85b31770d1bd3c121291d53bf366469967edd09c6fdef2ec4cf7663dcef.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高槻 つばさ","creatorId":"vndb:s1610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1610","name":"雪野 梨沙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71674","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33475","characterName":"ジャガーマン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18910","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"10957"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11893"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33475"},"originalCharacterName":"ジャガーマン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"牙持つ獣頭を備えた男。リリィを付け狙う。 《地下世界》 の人間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"南米出身であると自称するが、スペイン語は不慣れの模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼は 《地下世界》 を支配する何者かの部下であり、本来であれば異形の 《地下世界》 にいるはずのない存在であり、本来はこういった姿もしていないという。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マンハッタンの塔を目指すリリィを阻むべく、幾つかの罠を仕掛ける。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11893","sourceWorkId":"14286","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着尖牙的兽头的男人。紧盯着リリィ。《地下世界》的人类。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称出身于南美，但似乎不擅长西班牙语。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他是支配着《地下世界》的什么人的部下，本来不应存在于这异样的《地下世界》，本来也不是现在这个样子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"阻止着前往曼哈顿的塔的リリィ，设置了若干陷阱。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18910"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/639a60576e4329f0b50d4f2ab41b5da93977968c776941f910fd4bbb9bf0405b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4ac83216b491785d519ca4ee28d6db0f14a6c869950dc2fd346b177ef2c6b4a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蘭丸","creatorId":"vndb:s836","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s836","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s836","name":"蘭丸(声優)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71672","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20177","characterName":"リリィ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20177"},"originalCharacterName":"リリィ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the main heroines, and the one who wanders the fantastical Underground."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first this young girl is seen dressing as a man, and she frequently sports either a cold or slightly upset expression. She's simple, frank, and rather childish for her appearance. Occasionally she also displays an unexpected strength of will."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has no memories about herself, and she doesn't even understand why she is in the Underground New York City full of fantasies and distortions. The first memory she has is opening her eyes and seeing that false, violet sky. Though she recognizes the Underground as fantastic and abnormal, she has no desire to return to the surface. Even when asked about that, she only gives back a look of confusion. At first she doesn't understand that her world is the one full of fantasies and illusions while the real New York is in ruins."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She shows curiosity and interest in everything she lays eyes upon. She's lost all memory of everything save her language and common sense, yet despite that she knows she must go forth to the tower of violet shadow towering over Manhattan. At first she's lacking in humanity, but as she meets new people and witnesses their Refrains, she finds herself unwittingly shedding tears and eventually realizing the strength of the feelings deep within her—"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20177"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5ecea4197852294e319038df51ce089bf10a15a1e5d6c2aed311ade676c6cfa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6ac6b021c0c35c3297a6e65579d8a888a2c5c23f3ad3f7fa5f6aaaa14ac6975f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71666","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c33497","characterName":"エリシア・ウェントワース","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c33497"},"originalCharacterName":"エリシア・ウェントワース","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},